{
    "name": "E2E Shopify - Inventory Level Updated Trigger",
    "description": "Inventory Level Updated fires when the available quantity of a new product is set.",
    "notes": {
        "066f2824-96a4-4056-abfa-2ccfa5d4fba8": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nOne minute after the start (keep the **Wait**: the webhook subscription needs it to become active) the bottom lane creates a draft product (**Create Product**) and sets its available quantity to 7 (**Set Inventory Quantity**, which switches inventory tracking on and stocks the item at its location first).\n\nThe trigger lane asserts the emitted inventory level belongs to that product and deletes the product after `AfterAll` (**Delete Product**). The app needs `write_products` and `write_inventory`."
        }
    },
